The standard case is to enqueue data from user application side which then transparently gets sent out whenever the USB becomes free.

See https://github.com/stm32duino/Arduino_Core_STM32/blob/master/cores/arduino/stm32/usb/cdc/usbd_cdc_if.c as an example.

